WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.075
Clinical history shows the past records of a patient, without an active encounter.

1.2
00:00:06.075 --> 00:00:08.988
Step 1. Open the clinical history screen.

1.3
00:00:08.988 --> 00:00:12.613
In the Design area, select Clinical history.

2.1
00:00:12.613 --> 00:00:16.790
Step 2. Choose a starter. While this screen has no design,

2.2
00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:21.758
people who choose the workspace see the standard clinical history.

3.1
00:00:21.758 --> 00:00:25.368
Step 3. Arrange the tabs and their layouts.

3.2
00:00:25.368 --> 00:00:29.666
You add, hide and move tabs as on the Encounter screen.

3.3
00:00:29.666 --> 00:00:32.745
A hidden tab stays in the design.

4.1
00:00:32.745 --> 00:00:38.347
Step 4. Add sections. On this screen, the Patient history group comes first.

4.2
00:00:38.347 --> 00:00:41.797
You cannot add a section that needs an encounter,

4.3
00:00:41.797 --> 00:00:45.678
and sections here never let people make changes.

5.1
00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:47.774
Step 6. Check the design.

5.2
00:00:47.774 --> 00:00:53.682
Use the desktop and mobile buttons in the toolbar to check the design at desktop

5.3
00:00:53.682 --> 00:00:55.881
size and at phone size.

6.1
00:00:55.881 --> 00:00:59.425
Step 8. Save the design. Select Save Changes.

6.2
00:00:59.425 --> 00:01:05.061
If the workspace is Active, people who chose it see your tabs in the clinical

6.3
00:01:05.061 --> 00:01:07.098
history of a patient.
